Easily reproduced by extending the tests/core/math/test_expression.cpp file
```
// Pass
       CHECK_MESSAGE(
                       expression.parse("0000.5") == OK,
                       "The expression should parse successfully.");
// Fails
       CHECK_MESSAGE(
                       double(expression.execute()) == doctest::Approx(0.5),
                       "The expression should return the expected result.");
```
